cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Vehicle safety recalls matched across national registers on the manufacturer code
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: CarsMultiverse
    website: "https://carsmultiverse.com"
abstract: >-
  Vehicle safety recalls that appear in more than one country register, matched on the
  manufacturer own campaign code after identical normalisation. Joins the United States
  (NHTSA), Canada (Transport Canada) and the European Union (Commission Safety Gate).
  2100 recalls appear in more than one register. Nothing is paired on brand and date.
keywords:
  - vehicle safety
  - product recalls
  - NHTSA
  - Transport Canada
  - EU Safety Gate
  - open data
  - cross-border
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://carsmultiverse.com/data/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/carsmultiverse/recall-crosswalk"